Abstract = {Embong Brantas Area in Malang is one of vulnerable areas to flood.
   Objectives of the research were to analyze: 1) the disaster risk at
   Embong Brantas Area, in which vulnerability and hazard are variables of
   the research, 2) social adaptation that applies variables of land
   status, length of stay, education, income, numbers of the family member,
   type of buildings, and experience in disaster. Based on result of the
   analysis using GIS, it shows that 1.2 ha of Embong Brantas Area has high
   risk of flood, particularly in the next 100 years. Based on multiple
   regression analysis, status of land has affected 0.216 on adaptation of
   settlement by the community at the flood plains. (C) 2014 The Authors.
