Abstract = {Environmental enrichment (EE) paradigms are designed to enhance
   laboratory animals surroundings to encourage natural behaviors. Some
   enrichment paradigms also include a social component, based on the
   social interactions typical of the genus and species. Novel automatic
   methodologies based on image are becoming useful tools to improve
   laboratory works. This paper present a first approach to the automatic
   image analysis of laboratory rats in EE: behaviour, drug effects and
   pathology. The new methodology is based on image and Machine Learning
   paradigms and will become a useful tool for Neuroscience issues.},
